{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121232455786-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121235421\"/><p>荃灣屍體發現案。今日(21日)晚上7時03分，執法部門接獲有人報案，指懷疑有人暈倒在柴灣角街83至93號一工業大廈單位內。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，經驗查後事主被證實現場死亡。警員初步調查後，姓李(20歲)男事主為上址租客，其死因有待驗屍後確定，案件列「屍體發現」跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T16:13:53.261316+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T15:24:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:11.770223+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:11.770223+00:00","content_hash":"9798056b70b035a1f13e53adf55d7387468b34ad17f5b157aa6005dc6ff6ff9c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}